From: Emil <emil.grotta@colorado.edu>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:33:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] feat(web): optional per-thread tokens/sec readout

Shows the last finished turn's average output tokens per second in the
thread details context section. Off by default; the toggle lives under the
context window row and is remembered per thread on this client. The rate
comes only from a complete provider-reported main-agent token total and the
turn's wall time, so providers that report nothing (or only partial totals,
or subagent turns) show no readout instead of an estimate.

Ported from the 6d450a42 series: upstream removed the composer context-window
meter (521ac7c218), so the readout and its toggle moved from the meter
popover to the thread details context section.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
